// Temporary hit points modeled with the existing Shielded buff
// (common/src/comp/buff.rs: "Temp-HP / absorb shield... Grants an absorb
// pool equal to strength that soaks incoming damage before real HP") -- an
// exact fit for temporary hit points, no new mechanism needed. 1-hour
// duration.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Shielded, data: BuffData(strength: 20.0, duration: Some(3600.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 30,
    meta: (school: Some(Necromancy), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
